00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
These companies pay you to train AI. Here's the catch nobody mentions.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,500
DataAnnotation pays you to write and grade chatbot answers. Reviews quote about twenty dollars an hour to start.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,000
But the entry test is one shot. No retakes, and you might not get an email if you fail.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Outlier lists generalist work at up to about fifteen dollars an hour.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
But workers say the queue can sit empty for days after you're accepted.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Prolific pays for research studies, and requires at least eight dollars an hour.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
So apply to three, not one. Getting accepted is not the same as getting work.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Follow for verified remote jobs every day.
